      "description": {
        "fun": "A little imp that sneaks into homes to steal things and generally make a nuisance of itself, then sucks up the annoyance it causes through its nose and feeds on it. Without negative feelings to absorb, it gets grumpy. Impidimp live in groups and practise pranks on each other. It may nod to the Lincoln Imp, a carving in Lincoln Cathedral.",
        "guide": "A small Dark and Fairy-type imp Pokémon that feeds on negative emotions, causing trouble so it can absorb people's frustration. Its line is male-only and draws on imps and goblins from European folklore. It evolves into Morgrem and then Grimmsnarl.",
        "tagline": "A prankster imp that feeds on your frustration",
