      "description": {
        "fun": "Not confident in its strength, Morgrem fights dirty: it drops to all fours as if begging forgiveness, then stabs with its sickle-shaped hair once its foe lowers their guard. It lures people into the woods, yet some believe it can make crops grow. Its look recalls the redcap, a murderous goblin of English legend.",
