      "description": {
        "fun": "A hulking ogre whose hair works like muscle: wrapped around its body, it boosts Grimmsnarl's strength enough to overpower Machamp, and unfurled, it snares foes like tentacles. Even in this splendid form it can't give up petty pranks. It seems to play the green-skinned 'bad witch' to its counterpart Hatterene's good one.",
        "guide": "The final evolution of Impidimp, a Dark and Fairy Pokémon whose long hair wraps its body and works like muscle fibre. Based on ogres and trolls, it is the male-only counterpart of Hatterene. It has a Gigantamax form.",
